{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleaning.INC is a cozy, casual, and easy-going cleaning game where you take on the role of manager of a newly established cleaning company in town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover a vibrant and charming city as you complete your neighborhood missions. Meet the residents and help them with their misadventures through 25 varied and colorful levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorting, organizing, and cleaning will be your main tasks, but that's not all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stickers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn all the achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with over 120 items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple gameplay while continuing your chores at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is done with just one click!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, cozy, and colorful! Mini-games to keep you busy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double your bet at the casino or lose everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover cute, hand-drawn 2D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content update.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134300?t=1769121119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134300?t=1769121119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/aaad21b1cc1a8786ac79d197c0177ce0a25fb0fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769121119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/aaad21b1cc1a8786ac79d197c0177ce0a25fb0fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769121119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleaning.INC is a cozy, casual, and easy-going cleaning game where you take on the role of manager of a newly established cleaning company in town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover a vibrant and charming city as you complete your neighborhood missions. Meet the residents and help them with their misadventures through 25 varied and colorful levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorting, organizing, and cleaning will be your main tasks, but that's not all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stickers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn all the achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with over 120 items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple gameplay while continuing your chores at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is done with just one click!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, cozy, and colorful! Mini-games to keep you busy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double your bet at the casino or lose everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover cute, hand-drawn 2D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content update.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alex Falx"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app